### Run records

The phase timeouts were 180 seconds for JSON/log records, 120 seconds for
the other local cases and Canterbury, and 60 seconds for Silesia, enwik8
and the synthetic HTTP access log. Of 168 codec/workload/track cases,
154 verified and 14 timed out during compression. Rankings include
verified output only.

- `2026-11-03T06-29-44.647946+00-00-afa0e2b5` for the repeated JSON/log comparison.
- `2026-11-03T06-31-49.916393+00-00-62e698df` for the file and folder comparison.
- `2026-11-03T06-40-09.578295+00-00-9184192c` for Silesia, enwik8, and the HTTP access log.

| Workload | Track | Codec | Stage | Status |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| enwik8 | direct | Brotli | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Silesia Corpus | common-tar | Brotli | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Silesia Corpus | native | XZ | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Synthetic HTTP access log | direct | Brotli | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Silesia Corpus | native | Brotli | compress | TIMEOUT |
| enwik8 | direct | XZ | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Silesia Corpus | common-tar | 7-Zip | compress | TIMEOUT |
| enwik8 | direct | Bato 0.6 | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Silesia Corpus | common-tar | Bato 0.6 | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Silesia Corpus | common-tar | XZ | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Silesia Corpus | native | Bato 0.6 | compress | TIMEOUT |
| enwik8 | direct | 7-Zip | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Silesia Corpus | native | 7-Zip | compress | TIMEOUT |
| Synthetic HTTP access log | direct | XZ | compress | TIMEOUT |

The tested Bato 0.6 binary was built from `d6c2622`. Its SHA-256 was
`01774f788080227894e13354e33ac7dbd2653ab31d6d9d9cd14940c1841f3569`.
The JSON/log fixture SHA-256 is
`0cd430aa9192a136310540068e5fe913381094248c53f6d1259bb1f0225a01ee`.
Bato's output is byte-identical to Bato 0.5 on that fixture. In the earlier
five-run comparison, Bato 0.4 compressed it to 26,334 bytes and decoded it
in a 21.487787 s median. Bato 0.5 produced 21,856 bytes and decoded in a
0.009236 s median.

